### Did Joe Biden, as a presidential candidate in 2020, advocate for a complete federal ban on all fracking operations in the United States?
Answer: No, Joe Biden did not advocate for a complete federal ban on all fracking operations; as a 2020 presidential candidate, he explicitly stated, "I am not banning fracking." While he proposed ending new oil and gas drilling on federal lands, he did not support a nationwide ban on existing fracking operations.

Source URL: https://www.cnn.com/2020/08/31/politics/joe-biden-not-banning-fracking/index.html

### What was the official policy position on fracking published by the Biden 2020 presidential campaign?
